\paragraph{No backbone gradient} (\texttt{sdf\_grad\_to\_backbone = False}). Detaches the SDF head's input from the computation graph so that collision-related gradients train only the auxiliary head without modifying action generation weights. This isolates whether collision awareness must propagate into the backbone to influence the generated actions.

